        {"燃烧脚步","Burning Steps",474234,0,"邪能魔法从歼灭者萨祖克斯的脚下向外蔓延，每1秒对站在其中的玩家造成106681点火焰伤害。","Xathuux the Annihilator spreads fel magic across the ground from his feet inflicting 106681 Fire damage every 1 sec to any players standing in it."},
