        {"萨拉塔斯的赠礼","Xal'atath's Gift",1221063,0,"萨拉塔斯会降下星宇能量法球，尝试为周围生物施加萨拉塔斯的赠礼，使其造成的伤害提高5%，受到的伤害降低10%，持续20秒。此效果可叠加。玩家干扰法球可以将其力量化为己用，使自己的急速和移动速度提高2%，持续30秒。该效果可叠加。","Xal'atath rains down orbs of cosmic energy that attempt to grant nearby creatures Xal'atath's Gift, increasing their damage done by 5% and reducing their damage taken by 10% for 20 sec. This effect stacks.If players disrupt these orbs they claim the power for themselves increasing their Haste and Movement speed by 2% for 30 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"腐蚀唾液","Corroding Spittle",1228198,2,"咬咬朝玩家吐出唾沫，立即造成58189点火焰伤害，并在接下来的30秒内每3秒造成106681点火焰伤害。","Nibbles spits at players, inflicting 58189 Fire damage immediately and 106681 Fire damage every 3 sec for 30 sec."},
        {"非法灌注","Illicit Infusion",1230289,0,"凯斯媞亚为咬咬注入邪能魔法，使其在生命值高于20%时对玩家产生敌意。","Kystia infuses Nibbles with fel magic, turning her hostile to players while she is above 20% health."},
        {"光明灌注","Light Infusion",1230304,0,"当咬咬体内的邪能魔法耗尽时，她会恢复光明形态。在光明形态下，咬咬会试图用圣光灌注来净化凯斯媞亚体内的邪能。","When Nibbles is drained of fel magic she reverts to her light form. While in her light form, Nibbles attempts to purge the fel from Kystia with an infusion of light."},
        {"邪能飞溅","Fel Spray",1253811,0,"咬咬在其前方锥形区域释放邪能喷射，每1秒对区域内的玩家造成193965点火焰伤害，持续5秒。","Nibbles unleashes a spray of fel magic in a cone in front of her, dealing 193965 Fire damage to players caught in the spray every 1 sec for 5 sec."},
        {"邪能飞溅","Fel Spray",1253813,0,"咬咬在其前方锥形区域释放邪能喷射，每1秒对区域内的玩家造成193965点火焰伤害，持续5秒。","Nibbles unleashes a spray of fel magic in a cone in front of her, dealing 193965 Fire damage to players caught in the spray every 1 sec for 5 sec."},
      } },
      { {"利希尔·烬怒","Lithiel Cinderfury",234763,"Humanoid",1,""}, {
        {"混乱之箭","Chaos Bolt",474375,1,"利希尔·烬怒释放一道毁灭性的冲击，造成155172点混乱伤害。","Lithiel Cinderfury unleashes a devastating blast inflicting 155172 Chaos damage."},
        {"召唤邪犬","Summon Vilefiend",474408,0,"利希尔·烬怒召唤出一只邪犬。","Lithiel Cinderfury summons a Vilefiend."},
        {"古尔丹之指","Fingers of Gul'dan",474457,0,"利希尔·烬怒召唤恶魔魔法轰击每个附近的敌人，对每个目标6码范围内的所有敌人造成116379点暗影烈焰伤害。野生小鬼会从冲击点涌出并攻击附近的目标。","Lithiel Cinderfury calls down demonic magic to each nearby enemy inflicting 116379 Shadowflame damage to all enemies within 6 yds of each target. Wild Imps to burst from the impact sites and attack nearby targets."},
        {"古尔丹之指","Fingers of Gul'dan",474462,0,"利希尔·烬怒召唤恶魔魔法轰击每个附近的敌人，对每个目标6码范围内的所有敌人造成116379点暗影烈焰伤害。野生小鬼会从冲击点涌出并攻击附近的目标。","Lithiel Cinderfury calls down demonic magic to each nearby enemy inflicting 116379 Shadowflame damage to all enemies within 6 yds of each target. Wild Imps to burst from the impact sites and attack nearby targets."},
        {"恶魔传送门","Demonic Gateway",1214675,0,"利希尔·烬怒在两个位置之间创造恶魔传送门。激活传送门会将使用者传送到另一端，并使其免疫来自灾厄浪潮的初始伤害和火焰易伤效果。","Lithiel Cinderfury creates a demonic gateway between two locations. Activating the gateway transports the user to the other gateway and prevents initial damage and Fire vulnerability from Malefic Wave."},
        {"恶魔传送门","Demonic Gateway",1214730,0,"利希尔·烬怒在两个位置之间创造恶魔传送门。激活传送门会将使用者传送到另一端，并使其免疫来自灾厄浪潮的初始伤害和火焰易伤效果。","Lithiel Cinderfury creates a demonic gateway between two locations. Activating the gateway transports the user to the other gateway and prevents initial damage and Fire vulnerability from Malefic Wave."},
        {"恶魔传送门","Demonic Gateway",1214740,0,"利希尔·烬怒在两个位置之间创造恶魔传送门。激活传送门会将使用者传送到另一端，并使其免疫来自灾厄浪潮的初始伤害和火焰易伤效果。","Lithiel Cinderfury creates a demonic gateway between two locations. Activating the gateway transports the user to the other gateway and prevents initial damage and Fire vulnerability from Malefic Wave."},
        {"灼热邪焰","Searing Fel Flame",1216945,1,"利希尔·烬怒将自身包裹在邪能烈焰中，每1秒对敌人辐射19396点火焰伤害。","Lithiel Cinderfury engulfs herself in fel fire, radiating 19396 Fire damage to enemies every 1 sec."},
        {"灾厄浪潮","Malefic Wave",1217345,0,"利希尔·烬怒召唤一面邪能护盾，随后发出一道邪能火焰波。受到冲击的玩家每1秒受到14547点火焰伤害，且受到的火焰伤害提高50%，持续1分钟。此效果可叠加。被灾厄浪潮击中的恶魔将获得灾厄强化。","Lithiel Cinderfury conjures a Felshield and then projects a wave of fel fire. Impacted players suffer 14547 Fire damage every 1 sec and take 50% additional fire damage for 1 min. This effect stacks.Demons struck by Malefic Wave are granted Malefic Empowerment."},
        {"灾厄浪潮","Malefic Wave",1217384,0,"利希尔·烬怒召唤一面邪能护盾，随后发出一道邪能火焰波。受到冲击的玩家每1秒受到14547点火焰伤害，且受到的火焰伤害提高50%，持续1分钟。此效果可叠加。被灾厄浪潮击中的恶魔将获得灾厄强化。","Lithiel Cinderfury conjures a Felshield and then projects a wave of fel fire. Impacted players suffer 14547 Fire damage every 1 sec and take 50% additional fire damage for 1 min. This effect stacks.Demons struck by Malefic Wave are granted Malefic Empowerment."},
        {"邪能护盾","Felshield",1217415,0,"利希尔以邪能屏障环绕自身，受到的伤害降低50%，持续10秒。","Lithiel enshrouds herself in a fel barrier, reducing the damage she takes by 50% for 10 sec."},
        {"暗影撕咬","Shadow Bite",1217881,0,"近战攻击对目标敌人额外造成38793点暗影伤害。","Melee attacks inflict additional 38793 Shadow damage to target enemy."},
        {"灾厄强化","Malefic Empowerment",1226469,0,"被灾厄浪潮强化，急速提高100%。","Empowered by Malefic Wave, increasing haste by 100%."},
        {"灼热邪焰","Searing Fel Flame",1287627,0,"利希尔·烬怒将自身包裹在邪能烈焰中，每1秒对敌人辐射19396点火焰伤害。","Lithiel Cinderfury engulfs herself in fel fire, radiating 19396 Fire damage to enemies every 1 sec."},
