      { {"贝拉斯·黎明之刃","Belath Dawnblade",263940,"Humanoid",0,""}, {
        {"服务员","Server",1218465,0,"顾客就座后会随机点要食物或饮料，并在一段时间内等待你的服务，超时后顾客会变得不耐烦。有些顾客天生急躁，需要你立即提供服务。","Patrons request a random food or drink refreshment upon taking a seat, and will await your service for a short duration before becoming frustrated. Some patrons are impatient and will require your service quickly."},
        {"清洁工","Cleaner",1218466,0,"取得魔法扫帚，然后走向杂物和污渍进行清理，保持非法降雨酒吧的整洁！","Gather the enchanted broom and then move towards messes and spills to keep the Illicit Rain clean!"},
        {"表演者","Entertainer",1218467,0,"用令人难忘的精彩表演提升非法降雨酒馆的气氛值。穿上你的舞鞋，收集节拍音符来保持韵律。快速连续收集多个音符还能提升同事的工作表现！","Elevate the atmosphere of the Illicit Rain with a performance they'll never forget. Put on your dancing shoes, and gather notes of rhythm to stay on beat. Gathering multiple notes in rapid succession will improve the performance of your coworkers too!"},
        {"保镖","Bouncer",1218468,0,"粗鲁的顾客偶尔会出现并大发脾气，破坏非法降雨酒馆的气氛值。将这些粗鲁顾客踢向出口，强制他们离开。","Rowdy patrons occasionally show up and throw a temper tantrum, ruining the atmosphere of the Illicit Rain. Punt rowdy patrons towards the exit to force them to leave."},
        {"伪装","Disguised",1218508,0,"将目标伪装成非法降雨酒馆的员工。","Disguises the target as an Illicit Rain employee."},
