        {"过量物资","Overflowing Supplies",1235105,0,"囤宝狂人从他的蘑菇堆中取出蘑菇，使其获得过量物资。此效果会增加腐坏补给期间投掷出腐烂的蘑菇数量。","Gathering from his pile of mushrooms, the Hoardmonger gains Overflowing Supplies.This effect increases the amount of Rotten Mushrooms thrown during Spoiled Supplies."},
        {"饕餮怒吼","Hearty Bellow",1235125,0,"囤宝狂人从他的肉堆中汲取力量，解锁了饕餮怒吼。囤宝狂人发出一声震耳欲聋的咆哮，对所有玩家造成164870点物理伤害并将其击退，同时在接下来的10秒内每1秒额外造成29095点物理伤害。此伤害无视护甲。","Gathering from his pile of meat, the Hoardmonger unlocks Hearty Bellow.The Hoardmonger lets out a mighty roar, inflicting 164870 Physical damage to all players and an additional 29095 Physical damage every 1 sec for 10 sec and knocking them back. Ignores armor."},
        {"骨刺猛击","Bonespike Slam",1235129,0,"囤宝狂人从他的白骨堆中取出骨刺，使其能够施放骨刺猛击。囤宝狂人猛击地面，对前方锥形范围内的玩家造成484912点自然伤害。此外，还会生成持续45秒的白骨尖刺，接触时会施加骨刺扎入效果。","Gathering from his pile of bones, the Hoardmonger unlocks Bonespike Slam.The Hoardmonger slams the ground, inflicting 484912 Nature damage to players in a frontal cone. This additionally creates bone spikes for 45 sec which apply Bonespiked upon contact."},
        {"骨刺扎入","Bonespiked",1235405,0,"地面上散落着破碎的骨片，每0.5秒造成19396点物理伤害并使移动速度降低50%。","Broken bones litter the ground, inflicting 19396 Physical damage every 0.5 sec and reducing movement speed by 50%."},
        {"腐烂爆发","Putrid Burst",1245593,0,"蘑菇在12秒后爆炸，造成145474点自然伤害并对所有玩家施加剧毒孢子。","After 12 sec the mushroom bursts, inflicting 145474 Nature damage, applying Toxic Spores to all players."},
      } },
      { {"锐眼掠击鹰","Keen-Eyed Striker",241816,"Beast",0,""}, {
        {"萨拉塔斯的赠礼","Xal'atath's Gift",1221063,0,"萨拉塔斯会降下星宇能量法球，尝试为周围生物施加萨拉塔斯的赠礼，使其造成的伤害提高5%，受到的伤害降低10%，持续20秒。此效果可叠加。玩家干扰法球可以将其力量化为己用，使自己的急速和移动速度提高2%，持续30秒。该效果可叠加。","Xal'atath rains down orbs of cosmic energy that attempt to grant nearby creatures Xal'atath's Gift, increasing their damage done by 5% and reducing their damage taken by 10% for 20 sec. This effect stacks.If players disrupt these orbs they claim the power for themselves increasing their Haste and Movement speed by 2% for 30 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"剃刀俯冲","Razor Dive",1238439,8,"施法者跃向玩家并用喙撕扯，使其每1秒受到33944点物理伤害，持续10秒。此效果可叠加。","The caster jumps to a player and rips them with their beak, causing them to bleed 33944 Physical damage every 1 sec for 10 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"剃刀俯冲","Razor Dive",1238440,0,"施法者跃向玩家并用喙撕扯，使其每1秒受到33944点物理伤害，持续10秒。此效果可叠加。","The caster jumps to a player and rips them with their beak, causing them to bleed 33944 Physical damage every 1 sec for 10 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"强化隐形术","Greater Invisibility",110960,0,"使你隐形，无法成为敌人的目标，持续20秒并移除所有威胁值。任何动作都会解除该效果。","Makes you invisible and untargetable for 20 sec, removing all threat. Any action taken cancels this effect."},
        {"剃刀俯冲","Razor Dive",1238439,8,"施法者跃向玩家并用喙撕扯，使其每1秒受到33944点物理伤害，持续10秒。此效果可叠加。","The caster jumps to a player and rips them with their beak, causing them to bleed 33944 Physical damage every 1 sec for 10 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"剃刀俯冲","Razor Dive",1238440,0,"施法者跃向玩家并用喙撕扯，使其每1秒受到33944点物理伤害，持续10秒。此效果可叠加。","The caster jumps to a player and rips them with their beak, causing them to bleed 33944 Physical damage every 1 sec for 10 sec. This effect stacks."},
