      { {"寒冬哨兵","Sentinel of Winter",244100,"Humanoid",1,""}, {
        {"冰川折磨","Glacial Torment",1235548,0,"寒冬哨兵以极寒低温袭击玩家，每2秒造成67888点冰霜伤害，持续16秒。","The Sentinel of Winter assaults players with freezing temperatures, inflicting 67888 Frost damage every 2 sec for 16 sec."},
        {"冰川折磨","Glacial Torment",1235549,2,"寒冬哨兵以极寒低温袭击玩家，每2秒造成67888点冰霜伤害，持续16秒。","The Sentinel of Winter assaults players with freezing temperatures, inflicting 67888 Frost damage every 2 sec for 16 sec."},
        {"狂怒的飑风","Raging Squall",1235623,0,"寒冬哨兵召唤出数个狂怒的飑风，对冲击点4码范围内的玩家造成339439点冰霜伤害。这些飑风会在场地上游荡1.5分钟，对触碰到的玩家造成145474点冰霜伤害并将其击退。","The Sentinel of Winter creates Raging Squalls, inflicting 339439 Frost damage to players within 4 yards of the impact location. These squalls wander the arena for 1.5 min, inflicting 145474 Frost damage to players it hits and knocking them back."},
        {"狂怒的飑风","Raging Squall",1235635,0,"寒冬哨兵召唤出数个狂怒的飑风，对冲击点4码范围内的玩家造成339439点冰霜伤害。这些飑风会在场地上游荡1.5分钟，对触碰到的玩家造成145474点冰霜伤害并将其击退。","The Sentinel of Winter creates Raging Squalls, inflicting 339439 Frost damage to players within 4 yards of the impact location. These squalls wander the arena for 1.5 min, inflicting 145474 Frost damage to players it hits and knocking them back."},
        {"寒冰暴雨","Frozen Tempest",1235656,0,"寒冬哨兵唤出一场巨大的风暴，每1秒对所有玩家造成38793点冰霜伤害，并将他们向外推开。处于风暴之眼外的玩家每1秒会额外受到145474点冰霜伤害。","The Sentinel of Winter manifests a massive storm, inflicting 38793 Frost damage to all players every 1 sec, pushing them away.Players outside of the eye of the storm suffer an additional 145474 Frost damage every 1 sec."},
        {"寒冰暴雨","Frozen Tempest",1235658,0,"寒冬哨兵唤出一场巨大的风暴，每1秒对所有玩家造成38793点冰霜伤害，并将他们向外推开。处于风暴之眼外的玩家每1秒会额外受到145474点冰霜伤害。","The Sentinel of Winter manifests a massive storm, inflicting 38793 Frost damage to all players every 1 sec, pushing them away.Players outside of the eye of the storm suffer an additional 145474 Frost damage every 1 sec."},
        {"粉碎冰刺","Shattering Frostspike",1235783,0,"寒冬哨兵猛力击打冰层，形成2根冰柱，冰柱碎裂会对目标位置4码范围内的玩家造成387930点冰霜伤害，并暴露出碎裂的震颤核心。","The Sentinel of Winter slams the ice, forming 2 icicles which splinter, inflicting 387930 Frost damage to players within 4 yards of targeted locations, revealing a Fractured Shivercore."},
        {"粉碎冰刺","Shattering Frostspike",1235795,0,"寒冬哨兵猛力击打冰层，形成2根冰柱，冰柱碎裂会对目标位置4码范围内的玩家造成387930点冰霜伤害，并暴露出碎裂的震颤核心。","The Sentinel of Winter slams the ice, forming 2 icicles which splinter, inflicting 387930 Frost damage to players within 4 yards of targeted locations, revealing a Fractured Shivercore."},
        {"暴风雪之怒","Blizzard's Wrath",1236289,0,"寒冬哨兵以巨大的暴风雪环绕整个场地，对站在其中的玩家造成193965点冰霜伤害。","The Sentinel of Winter surrounds the arena in a massive blizzard, inflicting 193965 Frost damage to players standing within."},
        {"寒冰暴雨","Frozen Tempest",1297749,0,"寒冬哨兵唤出一场巨大的风暴，每1秒对所有玩家造成38793点冰霜伤害，并将他们向外推开。处于风暴之眼外的玩家每1秒会额外受到145474点冰霜伤害。","The Sentinel of Winter manifests a massive storm, inflicting 38793 Frost damage to all players every 1 sec, pushing them away.Players outside of the eye of the storm suffer an additional 145474 Frost damage every 1 sec."},
