      { {"碎裂的震颤核心","Fractured Shivercore",244759,"Elemental",0,""}, {
        {"雪流","Snowdrift",1234314,0,"碎裂的震颤核心被击败后，会在原地生成一堆深雪。站在雪堆中的玩家移动速度降低40%，并免疫强制位移效果。","Upon defeat, the Fractured Shivercore forms a pile of deep snow at its location. Players standing within have their movement speed reduced by 40% and are immune to forced movement effects."},
        {"寒冬帷幕","Winter's Shroud",1235829,1,"碎裂的震颤核心为玩家带来冬之严寒，对所有玩家造成96982点冰霜伤害，并使其受到的冰霜伤害提高10%，持续20秒。此效果可叠加。","The Fractured Shivercore blankets players with the chill of Winter, inflicting 96982 Frost damage to all players, increasing their Frost damage taken by 10% for 20 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"碎霜","Rimeshatter",1263590,0,"碎裂的震颤核心迸射出寒冰碎片，碎片在6秒后落地，对5码范围内的玩家造成58190点冰霜伤害。如果没有玩家被击中，碎片会破裂并引发白霜爆破。","The Fractured Shivercore bursts releasing ice shards that impact 6 sec later inflicting 58190 Frost damage to players within 5 yards.If no players are struck the shard fragments cause a Rime Detonation."},
        {"白霜爆破","Rime Detonation",1263597,0,"对所有玩家造成155172点冰霜伤害，并将其定身在原地，持续4秒。","Inflicts 155172 Frost damage to all players and roots them in place for 4 sec."},
      } },
      { {"神灵代言人纳尼亚","Loa Speaker Nanea",244889,"Humanoid",0,""}, {
        {"地震术","Earthquake",1247366,0,"纳尼亚使目标玩家所在位置的大地发生剧烈震颤与崩裂，对10码范围内的玩家造成12点自然伤害，并在接下来的30秒内每1秒对身处其中的玩家额外造成16点自然伤害。","Nanea causes the earth to tremble and break at target players' locations, inflicting 12 Nature damage to players within 10 yards and an additional 16 Nature damage to players standing within every 1 sec for 30 sec."},
        {"地震术","Earthquake",1247367,0,"纳尼亚使目标玩家所在位置的大地发生剧烈震颤与崩裂，对10码范围内的玩家造成12点自然伤害，并在接下来的30秒内每1秒对身处其中的玩家额外造成16点自然伤害。","Nanea causes the earth to tremble and break at target players' locations, inflicting 12 Nature damage to players within 10 yards and an additional 16 Nature damage to players standing within every 1 sec for 30 sec."},
