        {"地震术","Earthquake",1296722,0,"纳尼亚使目标玩家所在位置的大地发生剧烈震颤与崩裂，对10码范围内的玩家造成12点自然伤害，并在接下来的30秒内每1秒对身处其中的玩家额外造成16点自然伤害。","Nanea causes the earth to tremble and break at target players' locations, inflicting 12 Nature damage to players within 10 yards and an additional 16 Nature damage to players standing within every 1 sec for 30 sec."},
        {"动荡图腾","Volatile Totem",1309924,0,"纳尼亚制造多个图腾在战斗中协助她，这些图腾会释放出无常烈焰。","Nanea creates multiple totems to assist her in combat that release Volatile Flames."},
