      { {"纳洛拉克","Nalorakk",246404,"Beast",1,""}, {
        {"萨拉塔斯的赠礼","Xal'atath's Gift",1221063,0,"萨拉塔斯会降下星宇能量法球，尝试为周围生物施加萨拉塔斯的赠礼，使其造成的伤害提高5%，受到的伤害降低10%，持续20秒。此效果可叠加。玩家干扰法球可以将其力量化为己用，使自己的急速和移动速度提高2%，持续30秒。该效果可叠加。","Xal'atath rains down orbs of cosmic energy that attempt to grant nearby creatures Xal'atath's Gift, increasing their damage done by 5% and reducing their damage taken by 10% for 20 sec. This effect stacks.If players disrupt these orbs they claim the power for themselves increasing their Haste and Movement speed by 2% for 30 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"回响重击","Echoing Maul",1242860,0,"纳洛拉克标记玩家，持续4秒，随后在这些玩家的位置生成纳洛拉克的回响。所有纳洛拉克的回响会立即对8码范围内的玩家造成193965点自然伤害。","Nalorakk marks players for 4 sec, then sends an Echo of Nalorakk to their position. All Echoes of Nalorakk immediately inflict 193965 Nature damage to players within 8 yards."},
        {"回响重击","Echoing Maul",1242869,0,"纳洛拉克标记玩家，持续4秒，随后在这些玩家的位置生成纳洛拉克的回响。所有纳洛拉克的回响会立即对8码范围内的玩家造成193965点自然伤害。","Nalorakk marks players for 4 sec, then sends an Echo of Nalorakk to their position. All Echoes of Nalorakk immediately inflict 193965 Nature damage to players within 8 yards."},
        {"回响重击","Echoing Maul",1242887,0,"纳洛拉克标记玩家，持续4秒，随后在这些玩家的位置生成纳洛拉克的回响。所有纳洛拉克的回响会立即对8码范围内的玩家造成193965点自然伤害。","Nalorakk marks players for 4 sec, then sends an Echo of Nalorakk to their position. All Echoes of Nalorakk immediately inflict 193965 Nature damage to players within 8 yards."},
        {"战神之怒","Fury of the War God",1243002,0,"纳洛拉克以头撞击祖尔加拉，使其进入震荡冲击状态，随后命令纳洛拉克的回响向她的位置冲锋。每个回响会在碰撞首个目标时施放回响狂怒。任何抵达祖尔加拉的纳洛拉克的回响都会触发挫志怒吼。每个回响额外经历一次战神之怒后才会消失。","Nalorakk headbutts Zul'jarra into a Concussive Shock, then commands the Echoes of Nalorakk to charge her position. These collide with the first target encountered casting Echoing Fury.Any Echo of Nalorakk that reaches Zul'jarra triggers Demoralizing Scream. Each Echo remains for one additional Fury of the War God, then vanishes."},
        {"战神之怒","Fury of the War God",1243011,0,"纳洛拉克以头撞击祖尔加拉，使其进入震荡冲击状态，随后命令纳洛拉克的回响向她的位置冲锋。每个回响会在碰撞首个目标时施放回响狂怒。任何抵达祖尔加拉的纳洛拉克的回响都会触发挫志怒吼。每个回响额外经历一次战神之怒后才会消失。","Nalorakk headbutts Zul'jarra into a Concussive Shock, then commands the Echoes of Nalorakk to charge her position. These collide with the first target encountered casting Echoing Fury.Any Echo of Nalorakk that reaches Zul'jarra triggers Demoralizing Scream. Each Echo remains for one additional Fury of the War God, then vanishes."},
        {"战神之怒","Fury of the War God",1243273,0,"纳洛拉克以头撞击祖尔加拉，使其进入震荡冲击状态，随后命令纳洛拉克的回响向她的位置冲锋。每个回响会在碰撞首个目标时施放回响狂怒。任何抵达祖尔加拉的纳洛拉克的回响都会触发挫志怒吼。每个回响额外经历一次战神之怒后才会消失。","Nalorakk headbutts Zul'jarra into a Concussive Shock, then commands the Echoes of Nalorakk to charge her position. These collide with the first target encountered casting Echoing Fury.Any Echo of Nalorakk that reaches Zul'jarra triggers Demoralizing Scream. Each Echo remains for one additional Fury of the War God, then vanishes."},
        {"回响狂怒","Echoing Fury",1243408,0,"纳洛拉克的回响在冲锋时会猛击路径上的首个目标，造成67888点自然伤害。","The charging Echo of Nalorakk ravages the first target in their path, inflicting 67888 Nature damage."},
        {"压制强攻","Overwhelming Onslaught",1243569,0,"纳洛拉克向所有玩家发动一套毁灭性的攻击，在接下来的3秒内每1秒造成315193点物理伤害。这些攻击无视护甲。最后一击不仅会将所有玩家击退，还会使祖尔加拉昏迷。紧接着，纳洛拉克便会将目标转向祖尔加拉并施放强力猛击。","Nalorakk unleashes a devastating set of attacks on all players, inflicting 315193 Physical damage every 1 sec for 3 sec. These attacks ignore armor. The final hit stuns Zul'Jarra and knocks all players back. Nalorakk then targets Zul'Jarra with Forceful Slam."},
        {"警惕凝视","Watchful Gaze",1254622,0,"纳洛拉克屏息凝神地注视着，等待最终试炼的到来。","Nalorak watches and waits in anticipation for the final trial."},
        {"回响狂怒","Echoing Fury",1261976,0,"回响会猛击首个触碰的目标，造成38793点自然伤害。该回响会留存，并在下一次施放战神之怒时额外冲锋一次，之后才会消散。","The echo ravages the first target it touches, inflicting 38793 Nature damage.The echo will remain until the next cast of Fury of the War God where it charges one additional time before fading away."},
        {"压制强攻","Overwhelming Onslaught",1297792,0,"纳洛拉克向所有玩家发动一套毁灭性的攻击，在接下来的3秒内每1秒造成315193点物理伤害。这些攻击无视护甲。最后一击不仅会将所有玩家击退，还会使祖尔加拉昏迷。紧接着，纳洛拉克便会将目标转向祖尔加拉并施放强力猛击。","Nalorakk unleashes a devastating set of attacks on all players, inflicting 315193 Physical damage every 1 sec for 3 sec. These attacks ignore armor. The final hit stuns Zul'Jarra and knocks all players back. Nalorakk then targets Zul'Jarra with Forceful Slam."},
        {"压制强攻","Overwhelming Onslaught",1297793,0,"纳洛拉克向所有玩家发动一套毁灭性的攻击，在接下来的3秒内每1秒造成315193点物理伤害。这些攻击无视护甲。最后一击不仅会将所有玩家击退，还会使祖尔加拉昏迷。紧接着，纳洛拉克便会将目标转向祖尔加拉并施放强力猛击。","Nalorakk unleashes a devastating set of attacks on all players, inflicting 315193 Physical damage every 1 sec for 3 sec. These attacks ignore armor. The final hit stuns Zul'Jarra and knocks all players back. Nalorakk then targets Zul'Jarra with Forceful Slam."},
