      { {"振响的扭缠蛇","Rattling Writhe",262011,"Beast",0,""}, {
        {"萨拉塔斯的赠礼","Xal'atath's Gift",1221063,0,"萨拉塔斯会降下星宇能量法球，尝试为周围生物施加萨拉塔斯的赠礼，使其造成的伤害提高5%，受到的伤害降低10%，持续20秒。此效果可叠加。玩家干扰法球可以将其力量化为己用，使自己的急速和移动速度提高2%，持续30秒。该效果可叠加。","Xal'atath rains down orbs of cosmic energy that attempt to grant nearby creatures Xal'atath's Gift, increasing their damage done by 5% and reducing their damage taken by 10% for 20 sec. This effect stacks.If players disrupt these orbs they claim the power for themselves increasing their Haste and Movement speed by 2% for 30 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"腐蚀之牙","Corrosive Fangs",1294845,16,"扭缠蛇向目标注入强效毒液，造成242456点自然伤害，并使其受到的伤害提高20%，持续20秒。","The writhe injects the target with powerful venom, inflicting 242456 Nature damage and increasing damage taken by 20% for 20 sec."},
        {"振响","Rattle",1294849,0,"扭缠摇响尾巴，每1秒造成58189点物理伤害，持续5秒。该效果无视护甲。","The writhe rattles its tail, inflicting 58189 Physical damage every 1 sec for 5 sec. This effect ignores armor."},
        {"振响","Rattle",1294859,0,"扭缠摇响尾巴，每1秒造成58189点物理伤害，持续5秒。该效果无视护甲。","The writhe rattles its tail, inflicting 58189 Physical damage every 1 sec for 5 sec. This effect ignores armor."},
