        {"淬毒之刃","Laced Edge",1308518,0,"传送到一名玩家身后并劈砍他们，造成6点自然伤害，并在接下来的4秒内每1秒造成额外的3点自然伤害。","Teleports behind a player and slashes them, inflicting 6 Nature damage and an additional 3 Nature damage every 1 sec for 4 sec."},
