      { {"拉维","Rav'i",259445,"Beast",1,""}, {
        {"反刍","Regurgitate",1296050,0,"拉维向一名敌人呈直线喷吐3道胃酸波，对10码范围内的敌人以及卷入波浪的敌人造成290947点自然伤害，并使其移动速度降低50%，造成的伤害降低50%。","Rav'i hurls 3 waves of stomach acid in lines toward an enemy, inflicting 290947 Nature damage to enemies within 10 yards and enemies caught in the waves, and decreasing their movement speed by 50% and their damage done by 50%."},
        {"反刍","Regurgitate",1296058,0,"拉维向一名敌人呈直线喷吐3道胃酸波，对10码范围内的敌人以及卷入波浪的敌人造成290947点自然伤害，并使其移动速度降低50%，造成的伤害降低50%。","Rav'i hurls 3 waves of stomach acid in lines toward an enemy, inflicting 290947 Nature damage to enemies within 10 yards and enemies caught in the waves, and decreasing their movement speed by 50% and their damage done by 50%."},
        {"反刍","Regurgitate",1296069,32,"拉维向一名敌人呈直线喷吐3道胃酸波，对10码范围内的敌人以及卷入波浪的敌人造成290947点自然伤害，并使其移动速度降低50%，造成的伤害降低50%。","Rav'i hurls 3 waves of stomach acid in lines toward an enemy, inflicting 290947 Nature damage to enemies within 10 yards and enemies caught in the waves, and decreasing their movement speed by 50% and their damage done by 50%."},
        {"嘶嘶食腐","Ssscavenging",1296216,0,"拉维跑去啃食最近的腐肉堆，获得一个能吸收所有伤害的护盾。在她的护盾被移除之前，拉维每3秒对所有敌人施加腐肉喷发。[拉维狼吞虎咽，并且在嘶嘶食腐时会将腐肉块扔到坑里。]如果腐肉堆中包含鲜肉，拉维则会进入进食狂热状态。","Rav'i runs to feast on the nearest Carrion Pile, gaining a shield that absorbs all damage. Until her shield is removed, Rav'i applies Carrion Burst to all enemies every 3 sec.[Rav'i is a Messy Eater, and throws chunks of rotting meat across the pit while Ssscavenging.]If the Carrion Pile contains Fresh Meat, Rav'i goes into a Feeding Frenzy instead."},
        {"恶臭咆哮","Fetid Roar",1296219,0,"拉维因进食被打断而狂怒咆哮，消耗所有层数的饱腹，每层对所有玩家造成15点自然伤害。","Rav'i roars with rage at her meal being interrupted, consuming all stacks of Stuffed to inflict 15 Nature damage per stack to all players."},
        {"三重喷吐","Triple Shot",1296220,0,"拉维向3名敌人发射毒液球，每个毒液球会造成116379点自然伤害，并在10秒内每1秒对5码内的敌人额外造成41218点自然伤害。","Rav'i shoots globs of venom at 3 enemies that each inflict 116379 Nature damage and an additional 41218 Nature damage to enemies within 5 yd every 1 sec for 10 sec."},
