        {"嘶嘶食腐","Ssscavenging",1298223,0,"拉维跑去啃食最近的腐肉堆，获得一个能吸收所有伤害的护盾。在她的护盾被移除之前，拉维每3秒对所有敌人施加腐肉喷发。[拉维狼吞虎咽，并且在嘶嘶食腐时会将腐肉块扔到坑里。]如果腐肉堆中包含鲜肉，拉维则会进入进食狂热状态。","Rav'i runs to feast on the nearest Carrion Pile, gaining a shield that absorbs all damage. Until her shield is removed, Rav'i applies Carrion Burst to all enemies every 3 sec.[Rav'i is a Messy Eater, and throws chunks of rotting meat across the pit while Ssscavenging.]If the Carrion Pile contains Fresh Meat, Rav'i goes into a Feeding Frenzy instead."},
        {"多头蛇打击","Hydrastrike",1298683,0,"拉维的三个头颅都会攻击她当前的目标，造成物理伤害。","Each of Rav'i's three heads strike her current target, inflicting Physical damage."},
        {"狼吞虎咽","Messy Eater",1306345,0,"拉维的大嚼特嚼将腐肉块抛飞到深坑各处。每块腐肉都会对落点3.5码内的敌人造成116379点自然伤害。任何未被敌人接住的腐肉块都会发生爆炸，引发腐肉喷发。","Rav'i's chomping throws chunks of rotting meat across the pit. Each chunk inflicts 116379 Nature damage to enemies within 3.5 yards of its impact location. Each chunk that isn't caught by an enemy explodes in a Carrion Burst."},
        {"三重喷吐","Triple Shot",1307573,0,"拉维向3名敌人发射毒液球，每个毒液球会造成116379点自然伤害，并在10秒内每1秒对5码内的敌人额外造成41218点自然伤害。","Rav'i shoots globs of venom at 3 enemies that each inflict 116379 Nature damage and an additional 41218 Nature damage to enemies within 5 yd every 1 sec for 10 sec."},
        {"腐肉喷发","Carrion Burst",1307700,0,"腐肉和内脏的恶臭萦绕在所有敌人身上，每3秒造成29095点自然伤害，持续9秒。该效果可叠加。","The stench of rotting meat and viscera clings to all enemies, inflicting 29095 Nature damage every 3 sec for 9 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"鲜肉","Fresh Meat",1307703,0,"新鲜肉的味道使拉维陷入进食狂热，导致她的进食速度提高一倍。","The taste of Fresh Meat throws Rav'i into a Feeding Frenzy, causing her to eat twice as fast."},
        {"进食狂热","Feeding Frenzy",1307765,0,"拉维跑向最近的腐肉堆大快朵颐，获得一个能吸收所有伤害的护盾。在护盾被移除之前，拉维每1.5秒对所有敌人施加腐肉喷发。[拉维狼吞虎咽，并且在处于进食狂热时会将腐肉块扔到坑里。]","Rav'i runs to feast on the nearest Carrion Pile, gaining a shield that absorbs all damage. Until her shield is removed, Rav'i applies Carrion Burst to all enemies every 1.5 sec.[Rav'i is a Messy Eater, and throws chunks of rotting meat across the pit while in a Feeding Frenzy.]"},
        {"进食狂热","Feeding Frenzy",1307768,0,"进食狂热瞄准 (1​分钟 施法时间)","Feeding FrenzyChanneled (1 min cast)"},
        {"贪婪践踏","Ravenous Stomp",1307894,0,"拉维不耐烦地践踏，在神殿中引发一场地震，对所有敌人造成145474点自然伤害，并震落天花板上的几根钟乳石。每根钟乳石对冲击点5码范围内的所有敌人造成320042点自然伤害，并使被砸中的玩家昏迷2秒。飞行的双牙会被掉落的岩石刺穿，将鲜肉掉入拉维的深坑中。","Rav'i stomps impatiently, sending a quake through the temple that inflicts 145474 Nature damage to all enemies and breaks several stalactites from the ceiling. Each stalactite inflicts 320042 Nature damage to enemies within 5 yards of the impact and stuns players caught in the impact for 2 sec.Flying Twinfangs are skewered by the falling rocks, dropping Fresh Meat into Rav'i's pit."},
        {"贪婪践踏","Ravenous Stomp",1307915,0,"拉维不耐烦地践踏，在神殿中引发一场地震，对所有敌人造成145474点自然伤害，并震落天花板上的几根钟乳石。每根钟乳石对冲击点5码范围内的所有敌人造成320042点自然伤害，并使被砸中的玩家昏迷2秒。飞行的双牙会被掉落的岩石刺穿，将鲜肉掉入拉维的深坑中。","Rav'i stomps impatiently, sending a quake through the temple that inflicts 145474 Nature damage to all enemies and breaks several stalactites from the ceiling. Each stalactite inflicts 320042 Nature damage to enemies within 5 yards of the impact and stuns players caught in the impact for 2 sec.Flying Twinfangs are skewered by the falling rocks, dropping Fresh Meat into Rav'i's pit."},
