        {"嘶嘶食腐","Ssscavenging",1309522,0,"拉维跑去啃食最近的腐肉堆，获得一个能吸收所有伤害的护盾。在她的护盾被移除之前，拉维每3秒对所有敌人施加腐肉喷发。[拉维狼吞虎咽，并且在嘶嘶食腐时会将腐肉块扔到坑里。]如果腐肉堆中包含鲜肉，拉维则会进入进食狂热状态。","Rav'i runs to feast on the nearest Carrion Pile, gaining a shield that absorbs all damage. Until her shield is removed, Rav'i applies Carrion Burst to all enemies every 3 sec.[Rav'i is a Messy Eater, and throws chunks of rotting meat across the pit while Ssscavenging.]If the Carrion Pile contains Fresh Meat, Rav'i goes into a Feeding Frenzy instead."},
        {"血之气息","Scent of Blood",1310378,0,"如果最近的腐肉堆中包含鲜肉，拉维将获得血之气息，攻击速度提高30%。","If the nearest Carrion Pile contains Fresh Meat, Rav'i gains Scent of Blood, increasing attack speed by 30%."},
        {"贪婪践踏","Ravenous Stomp",1310413,0,"拉维不耐烦地践踏，在神殿中引发一场地震，对所有敌人造成145474点自然伤害，并震落天花板上的几根钟乳石。每根钟乳石对冲击点5码范围内的所有敌人造成320042点自然伤害，并使被砸中的玩家昏迷2秒。飞行的双牙会被掉落的岩石刺穿，将鲜肉掉入拉维的深坑中。","Rav'i stomps impatiently, sending a quake through the temple that inflicts 145474 Nature damage to all enemies and breaks several stalactites from the ceiling. Each stalactite inflicts 320042 Nature damage to enemies within 5 yards of the impact and stuns players caught in the impact for 2 sec.Flying Twinfangs are skewered by the falling rocks, dropping Fresh Meat into Rav'i's pit."},
