      { {"扭缠盘蛇","The Writhing Coil",259446,"Beast",1,""}, {
        {"藤蔓之握","Vine Grip",1287798,0,"奥威娜用强大的藤蔓将玩家与扭缠盘蛇相连。所有被连接的玩家移动至距离扭缠盘蛇10码以外的地方，将导致其解除盘卷。","Orweyna attaches players to the Writhing Coil with powerful vines. All attached players moving 10yd farther from the Writhing Coil causes it to Uncoil."},
        {"解除盘卷","Uncoil",1287811,0,"扭缠盘蛇被硬生生撕裂成无数条小蛇，对所有玩家造成145474点自然伤害。","The Writhing Coil is ripped apart into its constituent snakes , inflicting 145474 Nature damage to all players."},
        {"镰尾","Tail Scythe",1298949,0,"扭缠盘蛇用刀刃般的尾巴切割当前目标，造成678877点物理伤害。","The Writhing Coil slices its current target with a bladed tail, inflicting 678877 Physical damage."},
        {"濒死喘息","Death Rattle",1299053,0,"扭缠盘蛇持续发出骇人的响尾声，每1秒造成9698点物理伤害。该效果可叠加，并且每1秒增加一层，直到扭缠盘蛇被撕裂。","The Writhing Coil unleashes a relentless rattle, inflicting 9698 Physical damage every 1 sec. This effect stacks, and increases its applications every 1 sec until the Writhing Coil is pulled apart."},
        {"濒死喘息","Death Rattle",1299080,0,"扭缠盘蛇持续发出骇人的响尾声，每1秒造成9698点物理伤害。该效果可叠加，并且每1秒增加一层，直到扭缠盘蛇被撕裂。","The Writhing Coil unleashes a relentless rattle, inflicting 9698 Physical damage every 1 sec. This effect stacks, and increases its applications every 1 sec until the Writhing Coil is pulled apart."},
        {"掘地冲锋","Burrowing Charge",1299130,0,"扭缠盘蛇在地下穿行，对路径上的敌人造成387930点自然伤害。","The Writhing Coil burrows across the ground, inflicting 387930 Nature damage to enemies in its path."},
        {"掘地冲锋","Burrowing Charge",1299135,0,"扭缠盘蛇在地下穿行，对路径上的敌人造成387930点自然伤害。","The Writhing Coil burrows across the ground, inflicting 387930 Nature damage to enemies in its path."},
        {"同步毒液","Synchronized Venom",1299154,0,"扭缠盘蛇向所有敌人喷射毒液，造成87284点自然伤害，并在35秒内每1秒额外造成16972点自然伤害。","The Writhing Coil shoots venom at all enemies, inflicting 87284 Nature damage and an additional 16972 Nature damage every 1 sec for 35 sec."},
        {"同步毒液","Synchronized Venom",1299189,0,"扭缠盘蛇向所有敌人喷射毒液，造成87284点自然伤害，并在35秒内每1秒额外造成16972点自然伤害。","The Writhing Coil shoots venom at all enemies, inflicting 87284 Nature damage and an additional 16972 Nature damage every 1 sec for 35 sec."},
        {"毒液喷射","Venom Jet",1299902,0,"扭缠盘蛇向一名敌人喷射毒液，对其前方锥形区域内的敌人造成387930点自然伤害。","The Writhing Coil unleashes a spray of venom at an enemy, inflicting 387930 Nature damage to enemies in a cone in front of it."},
        {"复仇猛攻","Vindictive Onslaught",1299940,0,"扭缠盘蛇对一名敌人发动一连串恶毒的攻击。","The Writhing Coil directs a sequence of vicious attacks at an enemy."},
        {"毒液喷射","Venom Jet",1300044,0,"扭缠盘蛇向一名敌人喷射毒液，对其前方锥形区域内的敌人造成387930点自然伤害。","The Writhing Coil unleashes a spray of venom at an enemy, inflicting 387930 Nature damage to enemies in a cone in front of it."},
        {"掘地冲锋","Burrowing Charge",1300083,0,"扭缠盘蛇在地下穿行，对路径上的敌人造成387930点自然伤害。","The Writhing Coil burrows across the ground, inflicting 387930 Nature damage to enemies in its path."},
        {"怨毒狩猎","Spiteful Hunt",1300503,0,"每条溃散的扭缠蛇都会锁定一名敌人。","Each Uncoiled Writhe fixates on an enemy."},
        {"解除盘卷","Uncoiled",1300612,0,"扭缠盘蛇分裂成溃散的扭缠蛇，每条都拥有扭缠盘蛇的一部分生命值。在20秒之后，溃散的扭缠蛇会施放同化，然后扭缠盘蛇会重新成型，生命值为所有溃散的扭缠蛇的总和。溃散的扭缠蛇容易受到群体控制效果的影响。","The Writhing Coil splits into Uncoiled Writhes, each with a portion of the Writhing Coil's health. After 20 sec, the Uncoiled Writhes cast Assimilation, and the Writhing Coil reforms with the combined health of the Uncoiled Writhes.Uncoiled Writhes are susceptible to crowd control effects."},
        {"同化","Assimilation",1300686,0,"所有溃散的扭缠蛇汇聚重组，重新组合成扭缠盘蛇。","All Uncoiled Writhes converge to reform into The Writhing Coil."},
        {"怨毒毒液","Spiteful Venom",1305368,16,"速效毒液渗入目标的血液，每1秒造成4点自然伤害，并使造成的伤害降低5%，持续3秒。此效果可叠加。","A fast-acting poison pervades the target's bloodstream, inflicting 4 Nature damage every 1 sec and reducing damage done by 5% for 3 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"暗掘","Undermining",1305393,0,"被击败时，一条溃散的扭缠蛇开始撼动大地，造成70点自然伤害并击退其上方的敌人。","Upon defeat, an Uncoiled Writhe begins destabilizing the earth, inflicting 70 Nature damage and knocking back enemies above them."},
        {"剧毒弹幕","Toxic Barrage",1310357,0,"扭缠盘蛇准备连续3次对敌人施加剧毒萎缩。","The Writhing Coil prepares to afflict its enemies with Toxic Atrophy 3 times in succession."},
        {"剧毒萎缩","Toxic Atrophy",1310547,0,"释放一种使所有敌人肌肉萎缩的毒素，使其造成的伤害降低20%，移动速度降低20%。该效果可叠加。","Releases a toxin that causes all enemies' muscles to wither away, reducing their damage done by 20% and their movement speed by 20%. This effect stacks."},
        {"剧毒萎缩","Toxic Atrophy",1310974,0,"释放一种使所有敌人肌肉萎缩的毒素，使其造成的伤害降低20%，移动速度降低20%。该效果可叠加。","Releases a toxin that causes all enemies' muscles to wither away, reducing their damage done by 20% and their movement speed by 20%. This effect stacks."},
