      { {"祖尔加","Zul'jan",259447,"Humanoid",1,""}, {
        {"毒牙仪式","Ritual of the Fang",1300876,0,"祖尔加挥舞乌拉特克之牙，此时蛇头会将远古光束集中到他身上，持续8秒，使其获得毒牙强化。如果被玩家拦截，光束则转为每1秒造成38793点自然伤害，并施加仪式毒液。","Zul'jan wields the Fang of Ula'tek as snake heads focus ancient beams into him for 8 sec, granting Fang Empowered.Upon interception by players, the beams instead inflict 38793 Nature damage every 1 sec and apply Ritual Venom."},
        {"毒牙仪式","Ritual of the Fang",1300886,0,"祖尔加挥舞乌拉特克之牙，此时蛇头会将远古光束集中到他身上，持续8秒，使其获得毒牙强化。如果被玩家拦截，光束则转为每1秒造成38793点自然伤害，并施加仪式毒液。","Zul'jan wields the Fang of Ula'tek as snake heads focus ancient beams into him for 8 sec, granting Fang Empowered.Upon interception by players, the beams instead inflict 38793 Nature damage every 1 sec and apply Ritual Venom."},
