        {"毒牙强化","Fang Empowered",1300892,0,"乌拉特克之牙随力量脉动，每1秒对所有玩家造成116379点自然伤害。该效果可叠加。","The Fang of Ula'tek pulses with strength, inflicting 116379 Nature damage to all players every 1 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"仪式毒液","Ritual Venom",1300894,0,"休眠毒素充满玩家体内，持续50秒。效果结束时，毒液发生喷发，造成387930点自然伤害。","Dormant toxins fill the player for 50 sec. Upon expiration, the venom bursts inflicting 387930 Nature damage."},
        {"仪式毒液","Ritual Venom",1300901,0,"休眠毒素充满玩家体内，持续50秒。效果结束时，毒液发生喷发，造成387930点自然伤害。","Dormant toxins fill the player for 50 sec. Upon expiration, the venom bursts inflicting 387930 Nature damage."},
        {"碎斧","Axegrinder",1301111,0,"祖尔加释放出旋转飞斧，在接触时将玩家开膛破肚，造成最多(121228 * 5)点物理伤害。此效果无视护甲。飞斧会在竞技场内反弹，其造成的伤害会随着速度的降低而减少。","Zul'jan unleashes spinning axes that eviscerate players on contact, inflicting up to (121228 * 5) Physical damage. This effect ignores armor.The axes ricochet through the arena, inflicting reduced damage as they lose speed."},
        {"碎斧","Axegrinder",1301114,0,"祖尔加释放出旋转飞斧，在接触时将玩家开膛破肚，造成最多(121228 * 5)点物理伤害。此效果无视护甲。飞斧会在竞技场内反弹，其造成的伤害会随着速度的降低而减少。","Zul'jan unleashes spinning axes that eviscerate players on contact, inflicting up to (121228 * 5) Physical damage. This effect ignores armor.The axes ricochet through the arena, inflicting reduced damage as they lose speed."},
        {"放血","Bloodletting",1301217,0,"祖尔加的物理技能会导致玩家大出血，移除仪式毒液效果，并制造出鲜血之池，身处其中的玩家每1秒受到96875点自然伤害。","Zul'jan's Physical abilities cause players to hemorrhage, removing applications of Ritual Venom and creating pools of blood inflicting 96875 Nature damage every 1 sec to players within them."},
        {"砍倒","Chop Down",1301350,0,"祖尔加对当前目标连砍两下，每次攻击造成484912点物理伤害。","Zul'jan hacks twice at his current target, inflicting 484912 Physical damage with each strike."},
        {"砍倒","Chop Down",1301353,0,"祖尔加对当前目标连砍两下，每次攻击造成484912点物理伤害。","Zul'jan hacks twice at his current target, inflicting 484912 Physical damage with each strike."},
        {"切骨者","Boneslicer",1301413,0,"祖尔加朝着一名玩家用力掷出飞斧，对路径上的所有玩家造成174568点物理伤害，并在接下来的7秒内每1秒额外造成43642点物理伤害。此效果无视护甲。","Zul'jan hurls an axe at a player, inflicting 174568 Physical damage to all players caught in its path and an additional 43642 Physical damage every 1 sec for 7 sec. This effect ignores armor."},
        {"切骨者","Boneslicer",1301508,0,"祖尔加朝着一名玩家用力掷出飞斧，对路径上的所有玩家造成174568点物理伤害，并在接下来的7秒内每1秒额外造成43642点物理伤害。此效果无视护甲。","Zul'jan hurls an axe at a player, inflicting 174568 Physical damage to all players caught in its path and an additional 43642 Physical damage every 1 sec for 7 sec. This effect ignores armor."},
