      { {"溃散的扭缠蛇","Uncoiled Writhe",262398,"Beast",0,""}, {
        {"萨拉塔斯的赠礼","Xal'atath's Gift",1221063,0,"萨拉塔斯会降下星宇能量法球，尝试为周围生物施加萨拉塔斯的赠礼，使其造成的伤害提高5%，受到的伤害降低10%，持续20秒。此效果可叠加。玩家干扰法球可以将其力量化为己用，使自己的急速和移动速度提高2%，持续30秒。该效果可叠加。","Xal'atath rains down orbs of cosmic energy that attempt to grant nearby creatures Xal'atath's Gift, increasing their damage done by 5% and reducing their damage taken by 10% for 20 sec. This effect stacks.If players disrupt these orbs they claim the power for themselves increasing their Haste and Movement speed by 2% for 30 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"怨毒狩猎","Spiteful Hunt",1300503,0,"每条溃散的扭缠蛇都会锁定一名敌人。","Each Uncoiled Writhe fixates on an enemy."},
        {"同化","Assimilation",1300618,0,"所有溃散的扭缠蛇汇聚重组，重新组合成扭缠盘蛇。","All Uncoiled Writhes converge to reform into The Writhing Coil."},
        {"同化","Assimilation",1300698,0,"所有溃散的扭缠蛇汇聚重组，重新组合成扭缠盘蛇。","All Uncoiled Writhes converge to reform into The Writhing Coil."},
        {"怨毒毒液","Spiteful Venom",1305368,16,"速效毒液渗入目标的血液，每1秒造成4点自然伤害，并使造成的伤害降低5%，持续3秒。此效果可叠加。","A fast-acting poison pervades the target's bloodstream, inflicting 4 Nature damage every 1 sec and reducing damage done by 5% for 3 sec. This effect stacks."},
        {"暗掘","Undermining",1305393,0,"被击败时，一条溃散的扭缠蛇开始撼动大地，造成70点自然伤害并击退其上方的敌人。","Upon defeat, an Uncoiled Writhe begins destabilizing the earth, inflicting 70 Nature damage and knocking back enemies above them."},
        {"剧毒萎缩","Toxic Atrophy",1310666,1,"释放一种使所有敌人肌肉萎缩的毒素，使其造成的伤害降低20%，移动速度降低20%。该效果可叠加。","Releases a toxin that causes all enemies' muscles to wither away, reducing their damage done by 20% and their movement speed by 20%. This effect stacks."},
