        {"毒蛇风暴","Serpentstorm",1293048,0,"米利克萨喷吐毒液，击退所有玩家并造成116379点自然伤害，随后在8秒内每1秒额外造成29095点自然伤害。风暴打击会出现在房间各处。","Merektha exhales, knocking back all players and inflicting 116379 Nature damage and an additional 29095 Nature damage every 1 sec for 8 sec.Storm Strikes occur across the chamber."},
