        {"燃烧腐蚀","Burn Corruption",267639,0,"姆沁巴用净化之焰锁定一名随机玩家，对冲击点10码范围内的玩家造成145474点火焰伤害，并留下一片燃烧之地。","Mchimba targets a random player with purifying flames, inflicting 145474 Fire damage to players within 10 yards of impact and creates a patch of Burning Ground."},
        {"埋葬","Entomb",267702,0,"把目标埋入密室内的一个墓穴，以便进行木乃伊制作仪式。在施放埋葬后，姆沁巴将在不同墓穴间移动并逐个打开墓穴，从没有包含被埋葬的玩家的墓穴开始。释放出被埋葬的玩家会中断该仪式，阻止姆沁巴释放出更多制成的木乃伊。","Entombs the target within one of the crypts inside the chamber. After casting Entomb, Mchimba will move between the crypts, opening them one at a time, beginning with the crypts that do not contain the entombed player.Releasing the Entombed player will interrupt the ritual, preventing Mchimba from releasing additional Finished Mummies."},
        {"燃烧之地","Burning Ground",267874,0,"对燃烧之地内的所有玩家每1秒造成145474点火焰伤害。","Inflicts 145474 Fire damage every 1 sec to any players inside a patch of Burning Ground."},
