        {"觉醒猛击","Awakening Slam",1312146,0,"姆沁巴用死疽能量猛击地面，对所有玩家造成193965点暗影伤害。这次猛击会导致随机墓穴打开，召唤出未完成的木乃伊。","Mchimba slams the ground with necrotic energy, inflicting 193965 Shadow damage to all players. The slam causes random crypts to open, summoning Half-Finished Mummy."},
