      { {"活性黄金","Animated Gold",135406,"Aberration",0,""}, {
        {"金光闪闪","Luster",265991,0,"为黄金风蛇张开护盾，吸收受到的伤害，相当于其生命值的10%，同时使其造成的伤害提高25%，直到此效果被移除为止。该效果可叠加。","Shields the Golden Serpent for 10% of its health in damage, and increases its damage done by 25% until removed. This effect stacks."},
        {"回响符文","Rune of Echoes",1289063,0,"你的核心符文（虚空之触宝珠）会在目标身上留下回响诅咒，持续10秒。诅咒会累积你的核心符文和萦绕符文对该目标造成的所有伤害或治疗的50%。当诅咒结束时，所有累积的伤害或治疗都将作用于该目标。","Your Core Rune (Void - Touched Orbs) leaves an echoing curse on the target for 10 sec that accumulates 50% of all damage or healing done to the target by your Core Rune and your Rune of Lingering.When the curse expires, all accumulated damage or healing is dealt to the target."},
