      { {"维克萨姆斯","Vexamus",194181,"Elemental",1,"Taunt"}, {
        {"奥术驱除","Arcane Expulsion",385958,0,"维克萨姆斯喷出大量奥术能量，对其前方的玩家造成436608点奥术伤害。","Vexamus ejects a mass of arcane energy inflicting 436608 Arcane damage to players in front of it."},
        {"法力炸弹","Mana Bombs",386173,0,"维克萨姆斯将易爆的魔力注入最多3名玩家体内，每1秒造成48491点奥术伤害，持续4秒。效果结束后魔力会爆炸，在4码范围内造成96982点奥术伤害，并留下一滩腐化法力，持续1分钟。","Vexamus infuses up to 3 players with explosive mana, inflicting 48491 Arcane damage every 1 sec for 4 sec. Upon expiration, the mana will detonate inflicting 96982 Arcane damage within 4 yards and leaving a pool of Corrupted Mana for 1 min."},
        {"法力炸弹","Mana Bomb",386181,0,"维克萨姆斯将易爆的魔力注入最多3名玩家体内，每1秒造成48491点奥术伤害，持续4秒。效果结束后魔力会爆炸，在4码范围内造成96982点奥术伤害，并留下一滩腐化法力，持续1分钟。","Vexamus infuses up to 3 players with explosive mana, inflicting 48491 Arcane damage every 1 sec for 4 sec. Upon expiration, the mana will detonate inflicting 96982 Arcane damage within 4 yards and leaving a pool of Corrupted Mana for 1 min."},
