        {"法力炸弹","Mana Bomb",386202,0,"维克萨姆斯将易爆的魔力注入最多3名玩家体内，每1秒造成48491点奥术伤害，持续4秒。效果结束后魔力会爆炸，在4码范围内造成96982点奥术伤害，并留下一滩腐化法力，持续1分钟。","Vexamus infuses up to 3 players with explosive mana, inflicting 48491 Arcane damage every 1 sec for 4 sec. Upon expiration, the mana will detonate inflicting 96982 Arcane damage within 4 yards and leaving a pool of Corrupted Mana for 1 min."},
        {"奥术宝珠","Arcane Orbs",387691,0,"教授从魔法书中召唤出附魔宝珠。宝珠会对击中位置3码范围内的目标造成290947点奥术伤害，并向维克萨姆斯移动。如果宝珠被维克萨姆斯吸收，此元素生物将会对所有玩家造成116685点奥术伤害。如果宝珠被玩家吸收，则会对其造成97254点奥术伤害。","The Professor conjures enchanted orbs from the magic book that inflict 290947 Arcane damage within 3 yards of impact and begin to gravitate towards Vexamus.If an orb is absorbed by Vexamus, the elemental inflict 116685 Arcane damage to all players. If an orb is absorbed by a player, it will inflict 97254 Arcane damage to them."},
        {"奥术裂隙","Arcane Fissure",388537,0,"能量达到100点时，维克萨姆斯用压倒性的力量引发爆炸，推开所有玩家并造成155172点奥术伤害。裂隙会在玩家的位置出现并爆发多次，每次爆发对4码范围内的敌人造成290947点奥术伤害。","Upon reaching 100 energy, Vexamus explodes with overwhelming power inflicting 155172 Arcane damage to all players and pushing them back. Fissures erupt multiple times at player locations, each inflicting 290947 Arcane damage within 4 yards."},
        {"奥术裂隙","Arcane Fissure",388546,0,"能量达到100点时，维克萨姆斯用压倒性的力量引发爆炸，推开所有玩家并造成155172点奥术伤害。裂隙会在玩家的位置出现并爆发多次，每次爆发对4码范围内的敌人造成290947点奥术伤害。","Upon reaching 100 energy, Vexamus explodes with overwhelming power inflicting 155172 Arcane damage to all players and pushing them back. Fissures erupt multiple times at player locations, each inflicting 290947 Arcane damage within 4 yards."},
