        {"分枝","Branch Out",388623,0,"过度生长的古树向某个区域扔出它的树枝，对周围8码范围内的玩家造成290947点物理伤害并将其击退。随后，古树树枝会活化并攻击玩家。","The Overgrown Ancient throws one of its own branches at a location, inflicting 290947 Physical damage to players within 8 yds and knocking them back.The Ancient Branch then animates and attacks players."},
        {"发芽","Germinate",388796,0,"每1秒，茂林古树都会使所有玩家脚下的休眠鞭笞者之种生根发芽，持续4秒。每个出现的种子都会击退4码范围内的玩家并对其造成242456点物理伤害，然后留下一株休眠的饥饿的鞭笞者。","The Overgrown Ancient forces dormant lasher seeds beneath all players' feet to sprout every 1 sec for 4 sec.Each emerging seed inflicts 242456 Physical damage to players within 4 yds and knocks them back, then leaves behind a dormant Hungry Lasher."},
        {"发芽","Germinate",388799,0,"每1秒，茂林古树都会使所有玩家脚下的休眠鞭笞者之种生根发芽，持续4秒。每个出现的种子都会击退4码范围内的玩家并对其造成242456点物理伤害，然后留下一株休眠的饥饿的鞭笞者。","The Overgrown Ancient forces dormant lasher seeds beneath all players' feet to sprout every 1 sec for 4 sec.Each emerging seed inflicts 242456 Physical damage to players within 4 yds and knocks them back, then leaves behind a dormant Hungry Lasher."},
        {"爆发苏醒","Burst Forth",388923,0,"达到100能量时，茂林古树将释放自身充沛的生命魔法来唤醒所有休眠的鞭笞者，当它们从地上挣脱时对所有玩家造成155172点自然伤害。","Upon reaching 100 energy, the Overgrown Ancient releases its abundant life magic to awaken all dormant Lashers, inflicting 155172 Nature damage to all players as they burst free from the ground."},
        {"休眠","Dormant",390297,0,"附近的恶毒的鞭笞者压制了生命能量。","Life energy suppressed by nearby Vile Lashers."},
        {"皲皮","Splinterbark",396716,8,"古树的树枝撕裂，碎片从中迸发出来，所有玩家因此流血，每3秒受到96982点伤害，持续1分钟。该效果可以叠加。","Splinters erupt from the Ancient as its branch is torn away, causing all players to bleed for 96982 every 3 sec for 1 min. This effect stacks."},
      } },
      { {"艾杰斯亚回声骑士","Algeth'ar Echoknight",196200,"Dragonkin",0,"Taunt, Incapacitate, Silence, Knock, Grip, Mind Control, Root, Fear, Disorient, Repentance, Sap, Stun, Slow, Sleep Walk, Hibernate, Mind Soothe"}, {
        {"星界旋风","Astral Whirlwind",1270349,0,"在目标敌人位置具象化一个星界投影。投影会在3秒后开始引导星界旋风，每0.5秒对8码范围内的敌人造成8点奥术伤害，持续15秒。","Manifests an astral projection at a target enemy's location. The projection starts an astral whirlwind after 3 sec, inflicting 8 Arcane damage every 0.5 sec to enemies within 8 yards for 15 sec."},
