      { {"多拉苟萨的回响","Echo of Doragosa",190609,"Dragonkin",1,"Taunt, Mind Soothe"}, {
        {"奥术飞弹","Arcane Missiles",373326,0,"多拉苟萨的回响对一名玩家造成96956点奥术伤害。对目标施加势不可挡。","The Echo of Doragosa inflicts 96956 Arcane damage to a player.Applies Overwhelming Power to the target."},
        {"能量炸弹","Energy Bomb",374343,0,"能量炸弹100 码范围1.5​秒 施法时间","Energy Bomb100 yd range1.5 sec cast"},
        {"能量炸弹","Energy Bomb",374350,2,"多拉苟萨的回响利用奥术能量随机标记数名玩家，持续6秒。能量炸弹结束时，对8码范围内的所有玩家造成116379点奥术伤害。对目标施加势不可挡。","The Echo of Doragosa marks random players with arcane energy for 6 sec. &nbsp;When the Energy Bomb expires, it inflicts 116379 Arcane damage to all players within 8 yards.Applies Overwhelming Power to the target."},
        {"能量炸弹","Energy Bomb",374352,0,"多拉苟萨的回响利用奥术能量随机标记数名玩家，持续6秒。能量炸弹结束时，对8码范围内的所有玩家造成116379点奥术伤害。对目标施加势不可挡。","The Echo of Doragosa marks random players with arcane energy for 6 sec. &nbsp;When the Energy Bomb expires, it inflicts 116379 Arcane damage to all players within 8 yards.Applies Overwhelming Power to the target."},
        {"力量真空","Power Vacuum",388822,0,"多拉苟萨的回响将所有玩家拉到她的位置，然后用爆炸性的能量执行打击，造成387825点奥术伤害并击退20码内的所有玩家。对所有被击中的玩家施加势不可挡。","The Echo of Doragosa pulls all players to her location, then strikes with explosive energy inflicting 387825 Arcane damage and knocking back all players within 20 yards.Applies Overwhelming Power to anyone hit."},
        {"释放能量","Unleash Energy",439488,0,"多拉苟萨的回响释放出强大的奥术能量，对所有玩家造成96982点奥术伤害，并在附近多个位置打开奥术裂隙。","The Echo of Doragosa unleashes powerful arcane energy, inflicting 96982 Arcane damage to all players and opening Arcane Rifts in nearby locations."},
        {"奥术裂隙","Arcane Rift",1279418,0,"溢出能量会汇聚成为一个奥术能量裂隙，每1秒对位于其中的玩家造成96982点奥术伤害。该裂隙偶尔会释放失控能量。","The excess power coalesces into a rift of arcane energy, inflicting 96982 Arcane damage every 1 sec to players within. This rift occasionally releases Uncontrolled Energy."},
        {"星界冲击","Astral Blast",1282251,0,"多拉苟萨的回响以强大的奥术能量冲击目标玩家，造成290947点奥术伤害并施加势不可挡。","The Echo of Doragosa blasts the target player with powerful arcane energy, inflicting 290947 Arcane damage and applying Overwhelming Power."},
        {"星界冲击","Astral Blast",1282252,0,"多拉苟萨的回响以强大的奥术能量冲击目标玩家，造成290947点奥术伤害并施加势不可挡。","The Echo of Doragosa blasts the target player with powerful arcane energy, inflicting 290947 Arcane damage and applying Overwhelming Power."},
