      { {"瑟拉奈尔·日鞭","Seranel Sunlash",231863,"Not specified",1,""}, {
        {"镇压力场","Suppression Zone",1224903,0,"瑟拉奈尔将护盾砸向地面，对8码范围内的玩家造成387930点奥术伤害并在冲击区域内召唤镇压力场。镇压力场会对其中的玩家施加沉默和平静效果同时驱散魔法效果。","Seranel slams his shield into the ground, inflicting 387930 Arcane damage to players within 8 yards and conjuring a Suppression Zone at the impact area.The Suppression Zone silences and pacifies players standing within and purges magical effects."},
        {"镇压力场","Suppression Zone",1225015,0,"瑟拉奈尔将护盾砸向地面，对8码范围内的玩家造成387930点奥术伤害并在冲击区域内召唤镇压力场。镇压力场会对其中的玩家施加沉默和平静效果同时驱散魔法效果。","Seranel slams his shield into the ground, inflicting 387930 Arcane damage to players within 8 yards and conjuring a Suppression Zone at the impact area.The Suppression Zone silences and pacifies players standing within and purges magical effects."},
