        {"静默浪潮","Wave of Silence",1225193,0,"瑟拉奈尔准备施放静默浪潮，对所有玩家造成145474点奥术伤害，并使镇压力场范围外的玩家平静，持续8秒。","Seranel readies a Wave of Silence, inflicting 145474 Arcane damage to all players and pacifying any player outside of the Suppression Zone for 8 sec."},
        {"静默浪潮","Wave of Silence",1225201,0,"瑟拉奈尔准备施放静默浪潮，对所有玩家造成145474点奥术伤害，并使镇压力场范围外的玩家平静，持续8秒。","Seranel readies a Wave of Silence, inflicting 145474 Arcane damage to all players and pacifying any player outside of the Suppression Zone for 8 sec."},
        {"静默浪潮","Wave of Silence",1225205,0,"瑟拉奈尔准备施放静默浪潮，对所有玩家造成145474点奥术伤害，并使镇压力场范围外的玩家平静，持续8秒。","Seranel readies a Wave of Silence, inflicting 145474 Arcane damage to all players and pacifying any player outside of the Suppression Zone for 8 sec."},
        {"符文印记","Runic Mark",1225792,0,"瑟拉奈尔向目标投掷奥术灌注的战刃，对4码范围内的玩家造成(9698 + 48491)点奥术伤害，随后每1秒造成额外48491点奥术伤害。战刃会弹射至1名附近玩家。","Seranel hurls an Arcane infused glaive at a target inflicting (9698 + 48491) Arcane damage and an additional 48491 Arcane damage every 1 sec to players within 4 yards. The glaive bounces to 1 nearby players."},
        {"符文印记","Runic Mark",1225796,0,"瑟拉奈尔向目标投掷奥术灌注的战刃，对4码范围内的玩家造成(9698 + 48491)点奥术伤害，随后每1秒造成额外48491点奥术伤害。战刃会弹射至1名附近玩家。","Seranel hurls an Arcane infused glaive at a target inflicting (9698 + 48491) Arcane damage and an additional 48491 Arcane damage every 1 sec to players within 4 yards. The glaive bounces to 1 nearby players."},
