        {"加速结界","Hastening Ward",1248689,2,"瑟拉奈尔以加速结界环绕自身，使其攻击速度提高100%，且自动攻击额外造成48491点奥术伤害，持续15秒。","Seranel surrounds himself in a hastening ward, increasing his attack speed by 100% and his auto attacks to inflict an additional 48491 Arcane damage for 15 sec."},
