        {"神经枢纽","Synaptic Nexus",1223936,0,"所有吉美尔鲁斯作为一个集体运作，共享生命值。","All Gemellus function as a collective, sharing health."},
        {"虚空分泌物","Void Secretions",1224104,0,"寰宇刺击产生一滩分泌物，每1秒对站在其中的玩家造成145474点暗影伤害。","Cosmic Sting forms a pool of secretions, inflicting 145474 Shadow damage every 1 sec to players standing within."},
        {"星界束缚","Astral Grasp",1224299,0,"吉美尔鲁斯向一名玩家引导暗影触须，每1秒造成38793点暗影伤害并将玩家拖向自身，持续8秒。","Gemellus channels a shadowy tendril at a player, inflicting 38793 Shadow damage every 1 sec and pulling the player towards them for 8 sec."},
