        {"神经链接","Neural Link",1253707,0,"吉美尔鲁斯与一名玩家建立神经连接，吸收等同于其最大生命值20%的伤害。被连接的玩家受到的伤害提高20%，持续12秒。如果玩家在神经链接效果结束前触碰与其相连的吉美尔鲁斯，将会造成干扰，移除吉美尔鲁斯的伤害吸收效果。","Gemellus forms a neural link with a player, absorbing damage equal to 20% of its maximum health. The player they are linked to receives 20% more damage for 12 sec.Players who touch the Gemellus who linked with them before Neural Link expires disrupts the connection, removing Gemellus' damage absorb."},
