        {"投掷萨隆邪铁","Throw Saronite",1261299,0,"加弗斯特向玩家投掷萨隆邪铁矿石，对冲击点10码范围内的玩家造成145474点物理伤害。矿石被摧毁后会变成萨隆邪铁淤泥。","Garfrost throws saronite ore at players, inflicting 145474 Physical damage to players within 10 yards of impact.The ore becomes Saronite Sludge and explodes into Ore Chunks when destroyed."},
        {"近战","Melee",1261315,0,"对目标造成物理伤害。","Inflicts Physical damage to the target."},
        {"碎矿猛击","Orebreaker",1261546,0,"加弗斯特释放毁灭性的重锤猛击，对其主要目标5码范围内的玩家造成678877点物理伤害并使其昏迷8秒。如果猛击击打到萨隆邪铁矿石上，则不会使造成昏迷，而是摧毁矿石。","Garfrost unleashes a devastating mace slam on players within 5 yards of his primary target, inflicting 678877 Physical damage and stunning them for 8 sec.If the slam strikes saronite ore, it no longer stuns, instead destroying the ore."},
        {"萨隆邪铁淤泥","Saronite Sludge",1261799,0,"被击碎的萨隆邪铁渗出有害物质，对其中的玩家造成96982点暗影伤害。","The smashed saronite oozes a harmful substance, inflicting 96982 Shadow damage to players within it."},
