        {"寒晶碎片","Cryoshards",1261921,2,"寒晶碎片猛击玩家，使其受到的冰霜伤害提高50%，并使其减速15%，持续12秒。","Shards of ice slam into players, increasing their Frost damage taken by 50% and slowing them by 15% for 12 sec."},
