        {"崩塌虚空","Collapsing Void",1263529,0,"达到100能量时，奈扎尔传送到房间中央，击退所有玩家，随后施放推斥原力不断将其推离。虚空能量开始向着奈扎尔崩塌，在9秒后形成虚空风暴。","At 100 energy, Nezhar teleports to the center of the room, knocking all players back while continuously pushing them with Repulsing Force. Void energy begins to collapse towards Nezhar, forming a Void Storm after 9 sec."},
        {"虚空风暴","Void Storm",1263532,0,"刮起猛烈的风暴，每2秒造成87284点暗影伤害，持续10秒。此外，风暴内部的玩家每1秒会额外受到174568点暗影伤害。","Raging storm that inflicts 87284 Shadow damage every 2 sec for 10 sec. Additionally, players inside the storm are suffer an additional 174568 Shadow damage every 1 sec."},
