        {"残杀","Decimate",1263282,0,"祖拉尔为拳头灌注虚空能量，挥拳怒击，对目标造成155172点暗影伤害，并在目标位置制造一滩虚空淤泥。","Zuraal infuses his fist with void energy and lashes out, inflicting 155172 Shadow damage to their target and creating a pool of Void Sludge at their location."},
        {"崩解虚空","Crashing Void",1263297,0,"达到100能量时，祖拉尔开始汇聚身边的虚空能量，将所有玩家和凝结虚空拉向自身。5秒后，祖拉尔释放汇聚的虚空能量，对所有玩家造成193965点暗影伤害并将其击退。","Upon reaching 100 energy, Zuraal begins to gather void energy around himself, pulling all players and Coalesced Void in. Zuraal unleashes the gathered void energy after 5 sec, inflicting 193965 Shadow damage to all players and knocking them back."},
        {"软泥猛击","Oozing Slam",1263399,0,"祖拉尔用虚空能量猛击地面，对所有玩家造成116379点暗影伤害，随后每1秒造成额外38793点暗影伤害，持续6秒。猛击还会使凝结虚空出现在附近位置。","Zuraal slams the ground with void energy, inflicting 116379 Shadow damage to all players and inflicting additional 38793 Shadow damage every 1 sec for 6 sec.The slam also spawns Coalesced Void in nearby locations."},
        {"虚空挥砍","Void Slash",1263440,0,"祖拉尔向目标发动三次强力挥击，前两击各造成290947点物理伤害，最后一击造成242456点暗影伤害。","Zuraal unleashes three powerful swipes at his target, inflicting 290947 &nbsp;Physical damage twice with another final strike inflicting 242456 Shadow damage."},
        {"虚空挥砍","Void Slash",1263484,0,"祖拉尔向目标发动三次强力挥击，前两击各造成290947点物理伤害，最后一击造成242456点暗影伤害。","Zuraal unleashes three powerful swipes at his target, inflicting 290947 &nbsp;Physical damage twice with another final strike inflicting 242456 Shadow damage."},
