        {"绝望音符","Notes of Despair",1265419,0,"鲁拉唱响黑暗歌谣，每0.3秒对所有玩家造成7274点暗影伤害，持续1.5秒。这首歌会产生数个绝望音符。","L'ura sings her dark song, inflicting 7274 Shadow damage to all players every 0.3 sec for 1.5 sec. This song creates multiple Note of Despair."},
        {"绝望音符","Note of Despair",1265420,0,"鲁拉唱响黑暗歌谣，每0.3秒对所有玩家造成7274点暗影伤害，持续1.5秒。这首歌会产生数个绝望音符。","L'ura sings her dark song, inflicting 7274 Shadow damage to all players every 0.3 sec for 1.5 sec. This song creates multiple Note of Despair."},
        {"绝望哀歌","Dirge of Despair",1265421,0,"鲁拉唱响绝望哀歌，立即对所有玩家造成96982点暗影伤害。这首歌会使所有绝望音符每2秒辐射9698点暗影伤害，直到被沉默。","L'ura performs the Dirge of Despair, immediately inflicting 96982 Shadow damage to all players. This song causes all Note of Despair to radiates 9698 Shadow damage every 2 sec until they are silenced."},
