        {"不谐射线","Discordant Beam",1265463,0,"鲁拉用声波能量冲击目标玩家，对直线范围内的所有玩家造成116379点物理伤害，并沉默被击中的绝望音符。此伤害无视护甲。","L'ura blasts target players with sonic energy, inflicting 116379 Physical damage to all players in the line and silencing any Note of Despair hit. This damage ignores armor."},
        {"幽冥和音","Grim Chorus",1265689,0,"鲁拉转变绝望音符，开始吟唱幽冥和音，持续20秒，对每个激活的绝望音符23码范围内的玩家造成242456点伤害。每有个激活的绝望音符每2秒对玩家施加苦痛，直到绝望音符被摧毁。","L'ura shifts the Notes of Despair and begins a Grim Chorus for 20 sec, inflicting 242456 to players within 23 yards of each active Note of Despair.Each active Note of Despair afflicts players with Anguish every 2 sec until the Notes of Despair are destroyed."},
        {"虹吸虚空","Siphon Void",1265999,0,"奥蕾莉亚吸取鲁拉的能量，使其昏迷且受到的伤害提高200%，持续20秒。","Alleria drains the power of L'ura, stunning her and increasing her damage taken by 200% for 20 sec."},
