        {"虚空传送门","Void Portal",1267274,0,"鲁拉每4秒被动地撕开一道虚空裂隙。打开3道裂隙后，鲁拉从每道裂隙中各召唤一支深渊之枪，每支长枪对她的目标造成96982点暗影伤害。此效果会关闭裂隙。","L'ura passively tears open a rift to the void every 4 sec. After 3 rifts are opened, L'ura summons an Abyssal Lance from each of them, inflicting 96982 Shadow damage to her target for each lance. This effect closes the rifts."},
